# simple calculator

me has a ask "first number?"
me has sign ask "what to do? (+ - * /)"
me has b ask "second number?"

if sign is "+"
    say a + b
else if sign is "-"
    say a - b
else if sign is "*"
    say a * b
else if sign is "/"
    if b is 0
        say "no can split by 0, silly"
    else
        say a / b
else
    say "ooga no know that sign"
